WEBVTT

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.170
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.950
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.280
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.120
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.820
With you guys

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.820
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.490
If we join forces

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.460
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.800
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:02.970
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:09.110
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.180
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.120
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.260
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.430
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.430
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.130
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:33.170
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.040
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:40.040
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.250
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:51.120
Someone once said...

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:54.830
If you split this type of 
prune and eat it together,

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:59.730
you'll be a couple that's madly in 
love for the rest of your lives...

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:04.340
Loving Couprune!

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:09.410
If you cut into this lemon pie with a knife,

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:10.940
fruit juice will spray up high

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.850
like a dazzling fountain, providing 
the finale of the meal...

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:18.880
Finalemon Pie!

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:23.550
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:29.660
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:35.870
The Upcoming Festival! 
Dangerous Wriggling Critters!

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:46.780
Delicious! This is fantastic! I'm so happy!

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.210
Thanks, Four Kings!

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:50.080
Three cheers for the Gourmet Age!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.520
It looks like there's no end in 
sight for this historic banquet!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.420
Everyone is grateful for their 
lives! Grateful for the food!

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:03.260
And especially grateful to the Four Kings!

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:11.040
Delicious! This is the best!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.200
Komatsu, keep it comin'!

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:14.310
Sure!

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:22.480
By the way, where's Teppei-san?

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.750
Now that you mention it...

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.350
Where'd that bastard go?!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.590
I ain't gonna be satisfied 
'til I kick his ass!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.790
Don't get yourself locked 
up in Gourmet Prison again.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:36.590
Well, considering his agility, 
I'd say he's gotta be safe.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:14.870
So you're finally awake...

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.200
Pukin-san...

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.410
You were out like a light 
for three days, Teppei-kun.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:23.140
Where am I?

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:24.680
My research facility.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.710
Near Life, the country of healing.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.920
What the hell happened to me?

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.650
Can you remember?

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:38.760
The Reviver network saved you.

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:41.590
I see...

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.730
I...

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.130
It'll get you killed.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.530
Right here...

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.900
...and now.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:53.740
I was...

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.510
...about to fight.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:01.510
But in the next instant, 
I felt something unusual.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:10.520
I was on a cutting board.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:14.860
For the first time in my life, I felt 
like I was going to become a meal.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:18.030
I steeled myself for the inevitable.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:22.530
Several warnings went off immediately.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.200
The Revivers came rushing over.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.870
Including me.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.570
Coming when you did

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:31.540
really saved me.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.210
My guess is that guy

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:36.880
didn't want to be seen 
by a big group of people,

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.050
so he hightailed it without murdering me.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.050
Who the hell was he?

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:45.890
He had a strange aura,

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:48.290
the likes of which I'd never sensed before.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.530
Here, drink this. It'll heal you.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.130
Thank you, Pukin-san.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:02.740
Butter Walnuts and Calorie Bananas, huh?

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:06.140
Both ingredients that are 
difficult to revive...

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:09.110
You never fail to impress, Pukin-san.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.920
But then, your master is a legendary Reviver.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:22.790
Do you have a sneaking 
suspicion too, Teppei-kun?

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:24.960
Yes.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:28.030
My master,

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.500
Mouyan Shy-shy,

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:34.910
is the greatest Reviver in the world

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.840
and a Gourmet Living Legend.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.510
Certainly, other than my master,

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:45.580
there's no one who can revive a 
Beast on the level of Four-Beasts.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:49.150
Where is he now?

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.120
I don't know.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:54.490
He disappeared several days ago.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:56.390
It's highly likely

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.900
that he knows something.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:02.830
We have to find his whereabouts 
as soon as possible.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:05.500
They're dangerous...

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:10.030
That's what my intuition 
as a Reviver tells me.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.180
Huh? Teppei-kun...

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:20.490
Maybe it's just my imagination...

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.490
But is the scar on your face growing?

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:23.860
Really?

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.520
No, it may just be my imagination.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.330
After all, there was nothing 
wrong with your body...

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:44.140
Come to think of it, Teppei said somethin' 
about a mastermind behind the scenes.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:48.910
All you gotta do is pulverize the bastard.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:51.350
We slew the Four-Beasts.

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:53.250
Whatever comes our way, we won't lose.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:54.990
I'll buy that.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:59.820
Still, the final blow that 
took down the Four-Beasts

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:02.230
was thanks to my gluttony, don't you agree?

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:03.730
Baloney, Toriko!

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:07.500
It's thanks to our beautiful 
appetites synchronizing,

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.730
especially mine!

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:12.140
But matching Toriko and Zebra's appetites

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:13.710
was hard work.

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:18.740
Soon enough, I'll be able to pull 
off techniques like that by myself.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:23.180
But with your appetites, you 
got a long ways to go yet.

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:24.720
Forget that, Zebra!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:28.550
Your gigantic horse wasn't 
able to beat the Four-Beasts?!

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:32.120
Hell if I know! I ordered 
it to stay outta the fight!

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:34.590
More importantly, there 
ain't enough grub here!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:36.790
Got it! I'll be right there!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.500
I see...

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:45.140
Preserving the color... When you 
think about it, it's simple.

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:46.340
Certainly.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:49.310
If only my thinking were 
one-millimeter more flexible,

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:51.580
it would've occurred to me too.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.810
Yet Komatsu-kun came up with this 
method in a matter of moments.

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:59.520
I must say, he really is something.

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:01.920
And it's not his skill or techniques...

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:05.260
I'm sure he heard the voices 
of these ingredients.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.030
I wonder if this is the first 
time he's hit on a cooking method

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.660
because the ingredients like him.

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:14.170
Maybe I'll recommend him

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.500
to G7.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:21.070
Setsuno-sama. I think perhaps there isn't 
even one millimeter of need for that.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.840
The way Komatsu-kun is now,

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.950
he's a shoo-in to be ranked.

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:29.610
True.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:31.350
And if he is,

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:35.950
he'll be able to participate in 
the festival too. I can't wait.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:39.520
Festival...

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.090
Let's meet at the festival.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.030
What's wrong, Toriko?

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:48.070
Nothing...

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.200
Well, anyway,

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:55.710
with this, we've captured all of the 
training ingredients on the old man's list.

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:57.240
Ozone Grass,

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.240
Melk Stardust,

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.910
Mellow Cola,

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.610
Shining Gourami,

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.480
Meteor Garlic,

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:06.280
Bubble Fruit,

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:08.320
and the Four-Beasts.

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:11.590
We've prepared ourselves to 
go into the Gourmet World.

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:18.660
The last time I challenged 
myself, I got owned,

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:22.130
but next time, I think I 
can stick around a while.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:26.070
In fact, I'm lookin' forward to seein' 
just how much stronger I've gotten.

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:27.710
Toriko-san...

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.710
And everyone else, too, please look.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:35.350
All those stars! They're 
beautiful, aren't they?

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.220
It's like we'll be swallowed 
by the night sky.

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:42.220
Toriko-san... Coco-san...

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:45.220
Sunny-san... Zebra-san...

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:47.090
Congratulations.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:50.360
And thank you!

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:51.660
Thank <i>you</i>,

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:55.170
for the Medicinal Mochi, Komatsu.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.330
Matsu!

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.700
I'm grateful to you too.

00:10:58.700 --> 00:10:59.840
Kid...

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.410
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:06.540
We didn't do anything 
that deserves gratitude.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:10.050
We were just hungry!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:13.520
That's right. Powerfully hungry.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:22.590
Somehow, the four of them did it.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:26.430
I knew Toriko-chan and the others 
would have no problem with it.

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:27.600
Yeah, well...

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:33.200
I was on the verge of getting 
in the way of their training.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:35.570
If you'd cut loose, Chief,

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:38.380
there would've been nothing 
for those four to do.

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:40.850
Hell yeah...

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:44.450
I'm just glad I avoided getting 
upbraided by the president.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:03.940
It seems the Human World has 
settled down for now, President.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:08.740
Well, I'd worry if they couldn't easily 
take down something like the Four-Beasts.

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:13.140
I believe the true enemy 
is still ahead of them,

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.680
but right now, we've all 
got other fish to fry.

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:20.590
For Toriko and the others,

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:23.960
there's one more job I want 
them to do in the Human World.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:26.790
Melk.

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:28.960
This is one fine knife.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.660
You crafted it well.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:38.100
With this I'll be able to cut through 
Acacia-sensei's Salad, AIR, like butter!

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:52.050
The others should be arriving at their 
respective places around about now.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:54.920
Alright, let's hit it!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.390
Time to go into action!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:58.390
Yes, sir!

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:07.900
Alright. This is it.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:33.660
This mountain of iron ore...

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.830
I better be able to at least shatter it.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.590
That thing punched right through 
the mountain and it's unhurt.

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:10.530
How the hell strong is its shell?!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:15.130
But it's strange. Is that 
a Steel Horseshoe Crab?

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:17.740
They don't live anywhere near here.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:21.040
But its meat is exquisite.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.810
So maybe I'll have a little snack.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:27.710
I give thanks for all of 
this world's bounty...

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.080
Let's eat!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:39.660
18-fold Spiked Punch!

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:52.240
The striking power of each 
Spiked Punch is increasing...

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:57.040
...but it still ain't enough.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.550
It's as juicy as sirloin, 
with a springy texture.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.090
I can't get enough!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.990
Hey, Toriko...

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:18.300
When this Measure Tongue 
wasn't perfected yet,

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:21.930
we tried it out on Terry, remember?

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:25.200
I sort of remember...

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:27.540
What do you think the number was then?

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.970
I dunno. Like 100?

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:33.410
Nope! The answer is "E"! Error!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.350
Error?

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:37.980
Yeah. Actually, the highest value 
this Measure Tongue goes up to

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.950
is 999!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:42.420
Isn't that incredible? So 
maybe Terry is over 1,000.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:47.790
Again, it wasn't perfected at the time, 
so we can't rely on that output, but...

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:51.800
Nah, I don't think he's over 1,000.

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:53.430
But...

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:57.100
...Terry inherited DNA from the Ancient King.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:02.310
It's possible that Measure Tongue 
picked up Terry's latent abilities.

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:07.950
Terry...

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:12.050
It may not be too long before 
you reach your potential.

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:15.450
Toriko-sama!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.120
Johannes!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.930
What are you doin'?

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:25.060
Make that, I'm surprised 
you were able to get here!

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:26.600
It was my duty.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.530
Toriko-sama...

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:31.370
I've come to pass on a request from IGO.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.840
You Four Kings Gourmet Hunters...

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:38.910
We want you to gather ingredients 
for the Cooking Festival.

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:40.580
For the Cooking Festival?

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:41.710
Yes.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.280
As you know,

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:47.890
the Cooking Festival is held 
only once every four years.

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:49.450
It's the mammoth event of the age,

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:53.790
and takes place on Cooking Island, 
the "Holy Land of Chefs".

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:55.530
For each day of the festival,

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:58.130
there are over one billion spectators.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:02.830
Live coverage of the event on TV garners 
over a 95% share of the ratings.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.570
Economically,

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:08.640
it brings a wave of prosperity 
all over the world.

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.780
But even though it's a festival that's 
loved by the entire human race,

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:14.010
because of the Four-Beasts' invasion,

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:17.750
it's become difficult to 
procure rare ingredients.

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:19.820
What are you sayin'?

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:22.350
All of the Biotopes,

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.420
including 8, have taken major damage.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:27.790
We can't supply ingredients to the Fest.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:33.100
On top of that, the ecosystem 
in each area has been destroyed.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.070
So that's why a Beast that's got 
no business bein' here, was.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.610
The ingredient we would like you to get

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:46.140
is a creature that's come 
from the Gourmet World.

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:49.210
A creature from the Gourmet World?!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:50.320
Yes.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.750
When the Four-Beasts invaded...

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:03.490
...it seems the seed of a certain Plant 
Beast was stuck to one of its bodies.

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:04.760
A seed?!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:07.130
It's blossomed and is growing.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:11.040
We believe it would be an interesting 
ingredient that would liven up the fest.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.640
I get it.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:14.070
Sounds like fun.

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.870
Alright, leave it to me!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:24.080
Festival, huh?

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:31.660
Colorful Color Rice Dangos, 
Medicinal Mochi-style, coming up!

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:37.560
Chef Komatsu is so awesome...

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:40.700
Yeah. By coming up with a simple 
way to make Medicinal Mochi,

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:43.470
he's become even more renowned.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.170
There was a ton of publicity 
when he created Century Soup,

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:48.670
but this goes even beyond that.

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:51.880
Chef Komatsu is so diverse!

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:53.610
We can't keep the customers away!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.410
And I can't keep my smile away!

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:03.790
Wait a second. I have a bad feeling...

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.120
Isn't this the usual pattern?

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:09.690
At the very best of times, that man...

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:13.160
That man always appears!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.810
I was right! He's here!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.040
Toriko-san!

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:25.910
Hi, Komatsu! How about goin' with 
me to capture an ingredient?

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:29.780
No way, no how! This time, forget about it!

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:32.920
Chef Komatsu has to work hard!

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:36.150
The restaurant would be in 
trouble without his presence!

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.990
Oh, come on! Don't be such a wet blanket!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.330
Forget it, I said!

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:48.770
Who are they?

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:11.660
It's a pleasure to meet you. I'm Kit from G7.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.990
I'm Painomi.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.800
W-W-Wha...?!

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:21.670
B-B-Both of you are members of G7?!

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.400
G7?!

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.570
Seriously?!

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:31.680
What business could members 
of G7 have with me?!

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:36.780
Chef Komatsu, we have come to tell you

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:42.050
that in the World Chef Ranking, 
you now rank in at number 88.

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:48.290
And as such, you're eligible to participate 
in this year's Cooking Festival,

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:51.160
so we've also come to invite you.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:57.600
Cooking Festival?!

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:08.510
I have been alone

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:15.920
Ever since that day

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:23.560
All I got was a definite history

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:30.270
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:33.640
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.140
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:39.110
A dream is still a dream

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:42.510
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:42.680 --> 00:21:46.950
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:50.620
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:58.660
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:04.100
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:08.570
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:18.450
Unmeasurable

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:14.250
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is... w-w-what?! 
"Unmeasurable"? That's totally tough!

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:16.310
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.450
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:23.120
Alright, Yun is hiding somewhere in here.

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:24.920
Will you be able to find him?

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:31.460
Yun is... right here!

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:38.500
Drawn in invisible ink, just like ninjas use!

00:22:38.700 --> 00:22:40.470
Don't try this at home, kids!

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:43.940
How was it? Were you able to find him?

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:47.050
You say, "There's no way 
I could've found him"?

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:50.080
Sorry. And now, let's move 
on to the next segment!

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:54.100
The Cooking Festival is almost here.

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:56.200
Toriko and his friends search for ingredients.

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:59.090
Their destination? The good old Baron archipelago!

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:02.350
Toriko vs. the Monster of the Gourmet World, Mon Plan!

00:23:02.590 --> 00:23:04.120
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
